                  <div class="col-12"><div class="form-check form-switch border rounded-3 bg-white p-3 ps-5"><input id="cpAutoExpire" class="form-check-input" type="checkbox"><label class="form-check-label fw-semibold" for="cpAutoExpire">Automatically enforce expiry</label><div class="small text-muted">When enabled, overdue accounts move to the EXPIRED profile and the active session is disconnected. Leave off for migration overrides to preserve connectivity.</div></div></div>
                  <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold" for="cpAccountStatus">Account Status</label><select id="cpAccountStatus" class="form-select"><option value="active">Active</option><option value="suspended">Suspended</option><option value="expired">Expired</option></select><div class="form-text">Expired status requires an expiry date in the past.</div></div>
                  <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Billing Status</label><select id="cpBillingStatus" class="form-select"><option value="paid">Paid</option><option value="unpaid">Unpaid</option></select></div>
                  <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Package</label><div id="cpPackageLabel" class="form-control bg-light">—</div></div>
                </div>
              </div></div></div>
              <div class="col-lg-5"><div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body"><h6 class="fw-bold mb-3">Recent Payments</h6><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Amount</th><th>Gateway</th><th>TrxID</th></tr></thead><tbody id="cpPaymentsBody"></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tab-pane fade" id="cp-tab-info">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body"><div class="row g-3">
              <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Full Legal Name</label><input id="cpFullName" class="form-control"></div>
              <div class="col-md-5"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Primary Phone</label><input id="cpPhone" class="form-control"></div>
              <div class="col-md-1 d-flex align-items-end"><a id="cpWhatsapp" class="btn btn-success w-100" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="WhatsApp"><i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i></a></div>
              <div class="col-12"><div class="border rounded-3 p-3 p-md-4 bg-light-subtle"><div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3 mb-3"><span class="rounded-3 bg-success-subtle text-success p-2"><i class="bi bi-chat-dots fs-5"></i></span><div><h6 class="fw-bold mb-1">Customer Contact &amp; Notifications</h6><div class="small text-muted">Save contact details now. Messages are sent only when the matching channel is configured in the main Notification Settings.</div></div></div><div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold" for="cpEmail">Email Address</label><div class="input-group"><span class="input-group-text"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i></span><input id="cpEmail" type="email" maxlength="254" class="form-control" placeholder="customer@example.com"></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold" for="cpWhatsappNumber">WhatsApp Number <span class="badge text-bg-light border">Optional override</span></label><div class="input-group"><span class="input-group-text text-success"><i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i></span><input id="cpWhatsappNumber" type="tel" maxlength="40" class="form-control" placeholder="Leave blank to use Primary Phone"></div><div class="form-text">If left blank, a valid Primary Phone is used as the default WhatsApp contact.</div></div>
                
                
                <div class="col-12"><div id="cpNotificationReadiness" class="alert alert-info py-2 mb-0 small"><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>Contact details are stored independently of sender configuration. Unconfigured channels will not send messages.</div></div>
              </div></div></div>
              <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Alternative / Emergency Phone</label><input id="cpAltPhone" class="form-control"></div>
              <div class="col-md-8"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Installation Address</label><input id="cpAddress" class="form-control"></div>
              <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">OLT / PON Port</label><input id="cpOltPon" class="form-control" placeholder="OLT-1 / PON-3"></div>
              <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Distribution Box / Splitter</label><input id="cpDistribution" class="form-control" placeholder="TJ Box #4 / 1:8 Splitter"></div>
              <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">ONU MAC</label><input id="cpOnuMac" class="form-control"></div>
              <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">ONU Serial</label><input id="cpOnuSerial" class="form-control"></div>
              <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Fiber Drop Core</label><input id="cpFiberCore" class="form-control" placeholder="Blue / Orange / Green"></div>
            </div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tab-pane fade" id="cp-tab-tech">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body"><div class="row g-3">
              <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">PPPoE Username</label><input id="cpUsername" class="form-control" readonly></div>
              <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold" for="cpRemoteAddress">Static IPv4 Address</label><input id="cpRemoteAddress" class="form-control" placeholder="Optional static IPv4 address"></div>
              <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">PPPoE Password</label><div class="input-group"><input id="cpPassword" type="password" class="form-control"><button id="cpPasswordToggle" type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary"><i class="bi bi-eye"></i></button></div></div>
              <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Admin Note / Comment</label><input id="cpRemarks" class="form-control" placeholder="Internal memo"></div>
            </div></div></div>
          </div>
